        <mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;b&gt;How to read this diagram&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;A rectangle is an entity (a table).&lt;br&gt;&#9671; a diamond is a relationship, labelled with its verb.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;1&lt;/b&gt; = the one side&#160;&#160;|&#160;&#160;&lt;b&gt;N&lt;/b&gt; = the many side&lt;br&gt;Read it as: one &lt;i&gt;parent&lt;/i&gt; row, N &lt;i&gt;child&lt;/i&gt; rows.&lt;br&gt;Every relationship here is 1-to-many.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#6c8ebf&quot;&gt;&#9632;&lt;/font&gt; Identity&#160;&#160;&lt;font color=&quot;#82b366&quot;&gt;&#9632;&lt;/font&gt; Content&#160;&#160;&lt;font color=&quot;#d79b00&quot;&gt;&#9632;&lt;/font&gt; Payment&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b85450&quot;&gt;&#9632;&lt;/font&gt; Taking&#160;&#160;&lt;font color=&quot;#9673a6&quot;&gt;&#9632;&lt;/font&gt; Practice&#160;&#160;&lt;font color=&quot;#666666&quot;&gt;&#9632;&lt;/font&gt; Reference" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;strokeColor=#999999;fillColor=#fafafa;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=8;rounded=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
